    <details><summary>What is the answer to Brain Puzzle 3 Level 80?</summary><p>In order: 1) Tap the coach’s head; 2) Swipe right on the head of the player on the left; 3) Tap the referee's money-counting hand; 4) Swipe left on the face of the player on the right; 5) Drag the chocolate from the ad to the trophy; 6) Tap the big screen; 7) Tap the censored middle finger of the player on the right; 8) Drag the paint to the banner; 9) Drag the gold medal from the coach's neck to the middle player</p></details>
    <details><summary>Why does nothing happen when I tap in Level 80?</summary><p>Level 80 mixes gestures: 3 drags, 4 taps, 2 swipes. Only the tap steps answer a single tap; the rest are drags or swipes. If a tap does nothing, try dragging the object onto the person or thing it belongs to.</p></details>
